  dialogueLines:
  - Huh, i thought these were forbidden in the house?
  - ...
  - It's nice to see that you dont confuse us anymore.
  - Such a funny thing.
  - I was always so jealous of those damn onions.
  - I really envied them.
  - So much attention was spend on them.
  - To keep them out of the house.
  - I just wanted to be seen.
  - But their shadows are long.
  - ...
  - I really loved your kuku piaz.
  - They were my favourite.
  - I know why you stopped making them.
  - But why didn't you just make them for me?
  - Why didn't you also think of me?
  - Why?
